%%MatrixMarket matrix coordinate pattern symmetric
% Unweighted path graph 1-2-3-4-5, as SuiteSparse ships graph adjacency
% matrices: pattern field, no diagonal. With --input-kind adjacency the CLI
% solves L = D - A; by default it reads the file as the operator and must
% reject it with a hint naming --input-kind adjacency.
5 5 4
2 1
3 2
4 3
5 4
